      <p>
        Notice that round-trip ping from Medellin to AWS us-east-1 sits between <strong>48ms and 56ms</strong> on primary fiber links. This is faster than cross-country traffic between Los Angeles and New York (~65ms), providing flawless voice, video, screen-sharing, and interactive SSH shell responsiveness.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
