      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
        6. Digital Nomad Visa Logistics: Colombia V-Category Nomad Visa Requirements & Tax Realities
      </h2>
      <p>
        Colombia offers one of the most accessible and popular digital nomad visas in the Western Hemisphere: the <strong>Visa V Nómadas Digitales (Resolution 5477)</strong>.
      </p>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Key Visa Specifications:</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Validity & Duration</strong>: Granted for up to <strong>2 years</strong>, allowing multiple entries and uninterrupted residency.</li>
          <li><strong>Minimum Monthly Income</strong>: Requires proof of foreign income equal to at least <strong>3 times the Colombian Minimum Monthly Legal Wage (SMMLV)</strong>, which equates to approximately <strong>$1,450 to $1,600 USD per month</strong> (demonstrated via 3 consecutive months of bank statements).</li>
          <li><strong>Tax Residency Trigger (183-Day Rule)</strong>: Spending more than <strong>183 continuous or discontinuous days</strong> within any 365-day rolling period triggers Colombian tax residency, subjecting your worldwide income to progressive personal income tax brackets (up to 39%). Many nomads structure their stay to remain under 180 days per calendar year.</li>
          <li><strong>Application Timeline</strong>: Applications are submitted online through the Cancillería portal; approval times average <strong>15 to 30 business days</strong>.</li>
        </ul>
